crates/sky-types/tests/ui/ok_cholesky_rewrite.sky:5:5: note: `A⁻¹ @ b` is rewritten to a Cholesky solve
  |
5 | x = A⁻¹ @ b
  |     ^^^^^^^
  |     - positive definite
  = note: rewrite `A⁻¹ @ b` to a Cholesky solve: A is Matrix[3,3] and PositiveDefinite, b is Vector[3]. Factor A = L·Lᵀ (L lower-triangular), solve L·y = b, then Lᵀ·x = y. x = A⁻¹·b is Vector[3], and A⁻¹ is never formed.

crates/sky-types/tests/ui/ok_cholesky_rewrite.sky:6:5: note: `inv(A) @ b` is rewritten to a Cholesky solve
  |
6 | y = inv(A) @ b
  |     ^^^^^^^^^^
  |         - positive definite
  = note: rewrite `A⁻¹ @ b` to a Cholesky solve: A is Matrix[3,3] and PositiveDefinite, b is Vector[3]. Factor A = L·Lᵀ (L lower-triangular), solve L·y = b, then Lᵀ·x = y. x = A⁻¹·b is Vector[3], and A⁻¹ is never formed.
